google-api-services-testing-v1-revsnapshot-1.25.0.jar is a temporary
custom-built version of com.google.apis:google-api-services-testing
with some additional APIs enabled: direct_access_version_info,
direct_access_supported and interactive_device_availability_estimate.
After making those changes, the jar was built by changing the
"testing.v1_external_java" target to a java_apiary_library rule.
The latest jar is built with cl/569268053.

documentNamespace, versionInfo and checksums fields should be updated
accordingly in
google-api-services-testing-v1-revsnapshot-1.25.0.jar.sbom.spdx.json.

google-api-services-testing-v1-revsnapshot-1.25.0.jar should be replaced
by the maven version of com.google.apis:google-api-services-testing
when APIs needed for direct access are included. (b/283120787).
